{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01318",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.95,
      "end_seconds": 4.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Sorry, doctor, shall I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.94,
      "end_seconds": 9.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.35,
      "end_seconds": 17.97,
      "duration_seconds": 7.62,
      "text": "Actually, honestly, it's an itchy rash, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.79,
      "end_seconds": 22.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "let's start with the the basic checks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.03,
      "end_seconds": 31.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.63,
      "end_seconds": 52.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 117 over 78, pulse 77."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.8,
      "end_seconds": 63.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.76,
      "end_seconds": 70.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "For about two weeks, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.28,
      "end_seconds": 77.15,
      "duration_seconds": 5.87,
      "text": "is it there all the time or does it come and go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.93,
      "end_seconds": 81.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "It's once or twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.85,
      "end_seconds": 86.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.87,
      "end_seconds": 96.14,
      "duration_seconds": 9.27,
      "text": "It usually comes with dry, scaly patches. Oh, you know, and redness. Had that since last weekend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.85,
      "end_seconds": 103.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.44,
      "text": "What about cracked skin on your hands, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.9,
      "end_seconds": 105.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "yeah, that too"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.6,
      "end_seconds": 112.03,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "Have you had an itchy rash before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.04,
      "end_seconds": 126.03,
      "duration_seconds": 11.99,
      "text": "Let me think, yes, something like this happened about six months ago, and it it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.8,
      "end_seconds": 133.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.66,
      "text": "Did you get oozing, similar rash in family members or breathing trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.83,
      "end_seconds": 142.75,
      "duration_seconds": 7.92,
      "text": "I haven't had oozing, similar rash in family members or breathing trouble, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.27,
      "end_seconds": 146.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Alright, how about new soap or detergent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.69,
      "end_seconds": 153.93,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any new soap or detergent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.67,
      "end_seconds": 159.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.08,
      "end_seconds": 164.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "No, uh, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.4,
      "end_seconds": 174.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "alright, any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.23,
      "end_seconds": 178.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "no, that's all normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.84,
      "end_seconds": 191.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.37,
      "end_seconds": 200.9,
      "duration_seconds": 7.53,
      "text": "let me think, I've had eczema for about a year now. Asthma, for two years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.08,
      "end_seconds": 218.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.97,
      "end_seconds": 235.13,
      "duration_seconds": 15.16,
      "text": "I, I take hydrocortisone cream, when needed for the eczema. Asthalin inhaler, when needed. I do miss it now and then, to be fair."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.62,
      "end_seconds": 240.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.78,
      "end_seconds": 252.88,
      "duration_seconds": 11.1,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.83,
      "end_seconds": 263.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.2,
      "end_seconds": 267.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "No, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.66,
      "end_seconds": 271.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 272.58,
      "end_seconds": 278.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "text": "Yes, I had a varicose vein procedure, last year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.54,
      "end_seconds": 283.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.07,
      "end_seconds": 286.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.82,
      "end_seconds": 290.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "right, tell me if that's sore"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.91,
      "end_seconds": 306.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.82,
      "text": "there are dry red patches in the creases of both elbows with scratch marks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.63,
      "end_seconds": 313.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Okay, uh, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.51,
      "end_seconds": 317.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.74,
      "end_seconds": 339.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "No signs of infection, no crusting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.5,
      "end_seconds": 358.38,
      "duration_seconds": 13.88,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed. Putting it all together, it's hard to say. An eczema flare-up is one possibility and a fungal infection another, and I'd rather not commit yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 358.97,
      "end_seconds": 362.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "What are the the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 368.78,
      "end_seconds": 389.85,
      "duration_seconds": 21.07,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like an eczema flare-up. Moisturise right after a bath, thick creams are better than lotions, and use a mild soap. Please come and see me in two weeks. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 391.79,
      "end_seconds": 396.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "Erm, no, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 398.12,
      "end_seconds": 399.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}